---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro'
import { renderPrivacyAnalytics } from '@zyankov/design-system/render'

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Zyankov.eu'
const description = 'Learn what information Zyankov.eu processes, how project preferences work, and how to contact us about privacy.'
const jsonLd = {
  '@type': 'WebPage',
}
---

<PageLayout title={title} description={description} path="/privacy/" noAds={true} project="hub" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
      <p class="eyebrow">Your information</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: November 12, 2026</p>
      <p class="intro">
        This policy explains what information may be processed when you visit Zyankov.eu,
        Letterwell, or BuildCalc. It describes the current site setup; please check it again
        whenever a project or third-party service changes.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>Who is responsible for your information?</h2>
        <p>
          The data controller for Zyankov.eu is Zlatko Yankov, based in Bulgaria. For privacy
          questions or requests, contact
          <a href="mailto:hello@zyankov.eu">hello@zyankov.eu</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Information processed when you visit</h2>
        <p>
          The hosting provider that serves these static pages may process technical request
          data such as your IP address, browser and device details, requested URL, and request
          time to deliver and secure the service. The site owner does not receive calculator
          inputs or word searches through an application backend. Hosting-provider logs are
          subject to the provider's own retention and privacy practices.
        </p>
        <p>
          Fonts and images are served from zyankov.eu itself. Pages do not request fonts from
          Google Fonts or other font services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Project data and local storage</h2>
        <p>
          Letterwell processes the letters you enter in your browser using a dictionary
          downloaded from this site. The letters are not sent to Zyankov.eu.
        </p>
        <p>
          Zyankov.eu saves the selected light or dark theme in browser local storage, and the
          choice applies to every project on the site. Letterwell also saves the selected language, and BuildCalc saves the
          measurement system. For "Your tools" on the homepage, the site also keeps the addresses
          of the last twelve tool pages you opened and the tools you starred as favourites; you can
          clear the history with the button on the homepage. The energy cost calculators keep the
          appliance list you build and the bill amount you enter. The daily word game keeps today's
          guesses, your statistics and the hints you opened, the daily anagram keeps today's progress and
          your statistics, and the Wordle solver remembers whether
          word meanings are shown. These preferences stay in your browser
          and are not sent to the site owner. You can remove them by clearing this site's stored data in your browser
          settings.
        </p>
        <p>
          Letterwell also keeps up to five recent searches in temporary page memory so you can
          reuse them while the page remains open. This search history is not saved to local
          storage and is cleared when you leave or reload the page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Pages on Zyankov.eu, Letterwell and BuildCalc load Google AdSense to show ads. This
          privacy policy and the terms of use load no ads. Google
          may process technical information such as your IP address and browser or device
          details, and may use cookies or similar technologies to serve, limit and measure ads
          and, where allowed, to personalise them.
        </p>
        <p>
          Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland see
          Google's consent message before personalised advertising is used. You can change or
          withdraw your choice at any time with <button class="link-button" type="button" data-zy-consent>Privacy settings</button>,
          also linked in the footer of every page.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can manage Google ad personalisation at
          <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" rel="noreferrer">My Ad Center</a>
          and read how Google uses information from sites that use its services at
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noreferrer">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <Fragment set:html={renderPrivacyAnalytics()} />
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your choices and privacy requests</h2>
        <p>
          You can control local storage through your browser settings. Depending on where you
          live, applicable data-protection laws may give you rights to request access,
          correction, deletion, restriction, or objection to certain processing.
        </p>
        <p>
          For a privacy question or request, contact
          <a href="mailto:hello@zyankov.eu">hello@zyankov.eu</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          This policy may be updated when the site or its services change. The date at the top
          shows when it was most recently reviewed.
        </p>
      </section>
</PageLayout>
